      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "86bebc1bcb42e60a30f03cf7dcda026430cfd31a61516a6e337ba834aa88b057"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L005",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F03",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_city",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "Окея сияла изящными городами, полными удивительных форм жизни.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L005_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.329,
      "camera_target": [
        0.25,
        0.392,
        0.231
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "a85d7bd3da6b12f7f07750c185bf91581b1692faed7c78cadcd3ac75f814e0e8"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F04",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_meeting",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Какой удивительный у вас мир!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L007_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.586,
      "camera_target": [
        0.59,
        0.412,
        0.125
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "b9604409bc7cf5c34e985b955a21d8cf414fb04736dba8bf6aeb18b0edb3968f"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F04",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_meeting",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_024",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Хочешь, покажу, как здесь всё устроено?",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L008_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.508,
      "camera_target": [
        0.865,
        0.415,
        0.125
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "b6e521dd89d77cf4043a01712b7881efe069604b0d2fab2d1e80dfe9708451ea"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F05",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_observes",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "Мика обратился за помощью к старейшинам Океи. Но они не смогли — или не захотели — ему помочь.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L009_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.079,
      "camera_target": [
        0.171,
        0.663,
        0.224
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "011f2d26ff511b313b70551c5907d9b245a175e7f300d937bd3fa6d4ea3df754"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L011",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F06",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_lizard_sad",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "thought",
      "spoken_text": "Что же мне теперь делать?..",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L011_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.351,
      "camera_target": [
        0.524,
        0.686,
        0.195
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "e63521fa8d60f78bfb3311cdf2892a42a86810f1fa4c1fc73aa2021690693343"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L012",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F06",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_lizard_sad",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_025",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Слышал, тебе нужна помощь.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L012_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.508,
      "camera_target": [
        0.414,
        0.622,
        0.19
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "bb072203e2f98ede58405e9d091d72fc6178cb9068c453762da9b02c2469c51d"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P01_L013",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P01_F07",
      "panel_id": "p31_okea_lizard_talks",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Да! Конечно!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/ru/CH03_P01_L013_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 1.802,
      "camera_target": [
        0.651,
